    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# WhatsApp Inbound Lead Engine\n*Website form → Claude-written WhatsApp reply in seconds*\n\n1. **Webhook** receives a form submission (Webflow or any site) and returns 200 straight away\n2. **Validate** required fields and normalise the phone number\n3. **Duplicate check** against the Leads sheet: repeat leads go to Slack only, with no second auto-reply\n4. **Claude** classifies intent, summarises the lead and writes a reply in the lead's language (max 700 chars)\n5. **Guardrails:** JSON parse with a safe fallback template, hard character cap, retries\n6. **In parallel:** send on WhatsApp + log to Sheets → Slack summary to the team\n\n## Setup\n- Credentials: Anthropic (Header Auth, name `x-api-key`), WhatsApp Business Cloud, Google Sheets, Slack\n- Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and `YOUR_WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID`\n- Sheet tab `Leads` with columns: lead_id, name, phone, inquiry, intent_classification, short_summary, created_at, status\n- POST JSON to `/webhook/webflow/lead`: `{name, phone, inquiry, source, timestamp}`",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2092,
        112
      ],
      "id": "333b2d2f-1e23-41f8-9f8c-32b839958d93",
      "name": "Overview"
    }
